<title>INDIA: India Finolex Ind 96/97 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India Finolex Ind 96/97 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     104.55  vs     92.60</p>
<p>    Sales/Income from  2,660.50  vs  2,607.77</p>
<p>	 Operations</p>
<p>    Other income	    41.34  vs     36.39</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  2,142.78  vs  2,149.08</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 289.22  vs    237.90</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   165.30  vs    164.58</p>
<p>    Tax			nil     vs    nil</p>
<p>Note: Finolex Industries Ltd said provision for Minimum Alternate Tax would be made at the end of the year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
